      "text": "Monday – Caracas – La Paz"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c3e951f8ddfb8c92f0d09edef79e6883e0d5e2cae02cda50cd10af8f1940aeda",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-wm-p7lxhnqwgwc",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to Caracas airport for your flight to La Paz. On arrival, you'll be met at the airport and taken to your hotel.\n\nStop at the Killi Killi viewpoint along the way. After checking in, take some time to rest.\n\nThen walk to the cable car station for panoramic views of the city. Continue on a walking tour of central La Paz, taking in Plaza Murillo, the government and Senate buildings, San Francisco Cathedral, and the Witches' Market and souvenir stalls.\n\nFrom the city centre, head to Moon Valley to see its unusual rock formations. Return to the hotel to rest.\n\n**Meals:** Breakfast."
    },
